                "box": {
                    "code": "\r\nlogsad(s)\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t// s = time to drop 6dB (in seconds)\n{\n\treturn\tLN2 / (s * samplerate);\n}\n\r\n// log smooth (attack/decay) envelope follower\nlogattackdecay(x, a, d)\t\t\t\t\t\t// a/d = attack/decay times (to 6dB) in seconds\n{\n\tHistory\tz(0);\n\tff\t\t= x - z;\n\ttt\t\t= (ff > 0) ? a : d;\n\tad\t\t= logsad(tt);\n\ty\t\t= (ff * ad) + z;\n\tz\t\t= y;\n\treturn\ty;\n}\n\r\nout1    = logattackdecay(in1, in2*0.001, in3*0.001);\r\n\r\n",
                    "fontface": 0,
                    "fontname": "<Monospaced>",
